<article class="env-lemma" id="06L6">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06L6">Lemma <span data-tag="06L6">90.26.2</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a deformation category. Let $U : \mathcal{C}_\Lambda \to \textit{Sets}$ be a deformation functor. Let $f: U \to \mathcal{F}$ be a morphism of categories cofibered in groupoids. Then $U \times _{f, \mathcal{F}, f} U$ is a deformation functor with tangent space fitting into an exact sequence of $k$-vector spaces </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  0 \to \text{Inf}(\mathcal{F}) \to T(U \times _{f, \mathcal{F}, f} U) \to TU \oplus TU  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/06L5" data-tag="06L5">90.20.1</a> and the fact that $\text{Inf}(U) = (0)$. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>